    "Source of truth for tools/generate-product-layout.py (task T05). Stored keys, domains and defaults are NOT changed by this file.",
    "Route tokens: S=STANDARD, F=LENS_FROSTED, C=LENS_CLEAR, X=CAPTURE, P=PLAIN_BLUR. LENS_MIXED (per-card selector 2, or HU/KG selectors disagree) = union of F and C, order of F first then C-only keys. Shade under the lens uses F (shade has no material).",
    "A key listed in main[route] is removed from every details group of the same (surface, route) (dedupe by the generator, not by hand).",
    "A details entry 'key@F,C' is structurally relevant only on those routes; outside them it is hidden (not disabled). Inside them, Applicability decides ACTIVE / NEEDS_RESTART / INACTIVE (disabled with reason).",
